<title>JAPAN: Kawasaki Steel to issue 10 bln yen straight bond.</title>
<headline>Kawasaki Steel to issue 10 bln yen straight bond.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-04-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>BORROWER - KAWASAKI STEEL CORP</p>
<p>LEAD MGR - Daiwa Securities</p>
<p>TRUSTEE - Dai-Ichi Kangyo Bank</p>
<p> TYPE straight bond   ISSUE NO  19	  AMT   10 bln yen</p>
<p> COUPON 1.90 pct	ISS PRICE 100 yen   MATURITY 25.Apr.03</p>
<p> LAST MOODY	     PAY DATE 25.Apr.97  INT PAY 25th Apr/Oct</p>
<p> LAST S&amp;P		 SIGN DATE	     SUB DATE 8.Apr</p>
<p>LAST JCR AA (tentative)</p>
